  epo:isSubjectToLotSpecificTerm <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/a9568989-991b-4aed-92ec-d8660c586b49-02/AccessTerm$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot8_TenderingTerms1>,
